      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Do not give him an 800mg dose of ibuprofen without consulting a doctor, as that is a significant dose for fever management. The confusion you are describing is a serious symptom that ibuprofen alone will likely not fix. Since it is late, if his confusion worsens, he becomes lethargic, or he starts having trouble breathing, you should seek emergency medical attention immediately. Otherwise, try to keep him comfortable and monitor his vital signs closely until morning.",
      "source": "target",
